cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "p-adic GRN Suite"
version: "v1.2.1"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
abstract: "Scientific software for p-adic analysis of Boolean and multi-valued gene regulatory networks. For a gene ordering, the scores mu_E, mu_A and mu_I sum the expanding, attracting and indifferent balls over the levels n = 0, ..., N-1, so that mu_E + mu_A + mu_I = N p^N."
